{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f7fbf9;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#65717b;--accent:#0b6b5a;--accent-2:#1f9d8a;--glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);--tile-size:28px}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:var(--muted);background:var(--bg);}
    .wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px;}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:24px;margin-top:26px}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(12,18,16,0.06)}
    h1{margin:0;font-size:20px;color:#0f2b25}
    p.lead{margin:10px 0 18px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45}
    .contact-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:#23423a}
    input[type="text"],input[type="email"],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6efeb;background:transparent}
    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .cta{display:inline-block;padding:10px 16px;background:var(--accent);color:white;border-radius:10px;border:none;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    /* Mood-to-Method */
    .mood-panel{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .methods{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .method{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f6fffb);border:1px solid #e2f4ee}
    .method h4{margin:0 0 6px 0;color:#0c5346}
    .method p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Progress meter / path map */
    .goals{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .goal{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbfffd);border:1px solid #eef6f2}
    .tiles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(15, var(--tile-size));gap:6px;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ffffff,#f8fff9);border:1px solid #e9f7f1}
    .tile{width:var(--tile-size);height:var(--tile-size);border-radius:4px;background:#f1f3f2;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04)}
    .legend{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px}
    .legend span{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:13px}
    .sw{width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px;display:inline-block}
    footer{margin-top:28px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}

    /* responsive */
    @media (max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.tiles{grid-template-columns:repeat(10,var(--tile-size));}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">WC</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:#102e27">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
        <a href="about.html">Approach</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Plans</a>
        <a href="services.html">Workflows</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="hero">
      <section class="card">
        <h1>Let’s set a steady course. Reach out for direction that fits your days.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Use the tools here to clarify what feels most urgent today and to sketch a practical 30‑day path. No medical advice — only habit-based steps and coaching frameworks for measurable shifts.</p>

        <div class="contact-grid">
          <div class="meta">Prefer a quick note? Call: <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> — or email: <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong></div>
          <label for="name">Name</label>
          <input id="name" type="text" placeholder="Your full name" />

          <label for="email">Email</label>
          <input id="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" />

          <label for="message">Message</label>
          <textarea id="message" placeholder="What outcome are you hoping for in the next month?"></textarea>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start">
            <button id="sendBtn" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
            <div class="meta">Or schedule: <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Book time</a></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside class="card">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight:700;color:#0f2b25">Mood‑to‑Method</div>
            <div class="meta">Pick how you are now — tailored next steps appear below and the primary button adapts.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:12px" class="mood-panel">
          <label for="mood">Right now I feel</label>
          <select id="mood">
            <option value="calm">Calm, steady</option>
            <option value="overwhelmed">Overwhelmed</option>
            <option value="stuck">Stuck</option>
            <option value="energized">Energized</option>
            <option value="adrift">Adrift</option>
          </select>

          <div id="methodArea" class="methods">
            <!-- method cards injected here -->
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr style="margin:14px 0;border:none;border-top:1px solid #eef6f2" />

        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700;color:#0f2b25">Map a 30‑day Path</div>
          <div class="meta">Choose up to 4 goals and tap to generate a simple daily rhythm you can follow.</div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px" class="goals">
            <label class="goal"><input type="checkbox" value="sleep" /> Sleep quality</label>
            <label class="goal"><input type="checkbox" value="movement" /> Movement</label>
            <label class="goal"><input type="checkbox" value="nutrition" /> Nutrition</label>
            <label class="goal"><input type="checkbox" value="focus" /> Focus / Work flow</label>
            <label class="goal"><input type="checkbox" value="social" /> Social rhythm</label>
            <label class="goal"><input type="checkbox" value="tools" /> Stress tools</label>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
            <button id="mapBtn" class="cta" style="background:var(--accent-2)">Map my 30‑day path</button>
            <div class="meta">Preview shows daily focus tiles and a brief week-by-week prompt set.</div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <div id="tiles" class="tiles" aria-hidden="false"></div>
            <div class="legend" id="legend"></div>
            <div id="planText" style="margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="meta">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — available for remote coaching.</div>
      <div class="meta">Questions? Email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Mood-to-Method data
    const methods = {
      calm: {
        label: 'Maintain & deepen',
        cta: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — refine plan',
        steps: ['Keep evening wind-down', 'Two consistency anchors (movement + focus)', 'Weekly check-in to adjust intensity']
      },
      overwhelmed: {
        label: 'Simplify to a few anchors',
        cta: 'Get a 2‑step reset',
        steps: ['Pick 1 core anchor (sleep or morning pause)', 'Block 15 minutes for priorities', 'Reduce decision points today']
      },
      stuck: {
        label: 'Micro-steps to restart',
        cta: 'Start a micro-habit plan',
        steps: ['Choose a tiny action (5 min)', 'Attach it to a stable cue', 'Scale after 7 consistent days']
      },
      energized: {
        label: 'Channel and structure',
        cta: 'Channel energy with a plan',
        steps: ['Use high-energy chunks for creative work', 'Schedule recovery windows', 'Batch similar tasks']
      },
      adrift: {
        label: 'Anchor then build',
        cta: 'Create a stabilizing plan',
        steps: ['Define a morning anchor', 'Pick a single priority each day', 'Map weekly touchpoints']
      }
    };

    const moodSelect = document.getElementById('mood');
    const methodArea = document.getElementById('methodArea');
    const sendBtn = document.getElementById('sendBtn');

    function renderMethod(key){
      const data = methods[key] || methods['calm'];
      methodArea.innerHTML = '';
      const card = document.createElement('div');
      card.className = 'method';
      const h = document.createElement('h4'); h.textContent = data.label; card.appendChild(h);
      const ul = document.createElement('div'); ul.style.marginTop='6px';
      data.steps.forEach(s=>{ const p = document.createElement('p'); p.textContent = '• '+s; ul.appendChild(p); });
      card.appendChild(ul);
      methodArea.appendChild(card);
      // update CTA text
      sendBtn.textContent = data.cta;
    }

    moodSelect.addEventListener('change',()=>renderMethod(moodSelect.value));
    // initialize
    renderMethod(moodSelect.value);

    // Progress meter / path map
    const mapBtn = document.getElementById('mapBtn');
    const tilesEl = document.getElementById('tiles');
    const legendEl = document.getElementById('legend');
    const planText = document.getElementById('planText');

    const colorMap = {
      sleep: '#2b7d65',
      movement: '#0f9d58',
      nutrition: '#f39c12',
      focus: '#2a7bd3',
      social: '#9b59b6',
      tools: '#e74c3c'
    };

    function gatherGoals(){
      const checks = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.goals input[type="checkbox"]'));
      return checks.filter(c=>c.checked).map(c=>c.value).slice(0,4); // up to 4
    }

    function buildPath(selected){
      tilesEl.innerHTML = '';
      legendEl.innerHTML = '';
      planText.textContent = '';
      if(selected.length===0){
        tilesEl.innerHTML = Array.from({length:30}).map(()=>'<div class="tile"></div>').join('');
        planText.textContent = 'No goals selected. Pick a couple of focus areas to see a suggested daily rhythm.';
        return;
      }

      // Create a repeating schedule over 30 days balancing selected goals
      const schedule = [];
      // Give first priority to sleep and focus if present
      const ordered = selected.slice();
      if(ordered.includes('sleep')) ordered.unshift(ordered.splice(ordered.indexOf('sleep'),1)[0]);
      for(let i=0;i<30;i++){
        schedule.push(ordered[i % ordered.length]);
      }

      schedule.forEach((s,i)=>{
        const d = document.createElement('div'); d.className='tile'; d.style.background = colorMap[s] || '#ddd'; d.title = 'Day '+(i+1)+': '+s; tilesEl.appendChild(d);
      });

      // Legend
      selected.forEach(s=>{
        const span = document.createElement('span');
        const sw = document.createElement('i'); sw.className='sw'; sw.style.background=colorMap[s];
        span.appendChild(sw);
        const txt = document.createTextNode(' '+toLabel(s));
        span.appendChild(txt);
        legendEl.appendChild(span);
      });

      // Week-by-week plan text
      const weeks = [
        'Week 1 — Set anchors: focus on habit cues, keep targets tiny.',
        'Week 2 — Build consistency: repeat anchors and add one micro-goal.',
        'Week 3 — Tune intensity: layer slightly more volume or challenge.',
        'Week 4 — Consolidate: choose what to keep and one reminder for maintenance.'
      ];
      planText.innerHTML = weeks.map((w,i)=>'<strong>Week '+(i+1)+':</strong> '+w+'').join('<br>');
    }

    function toLabel(key){
      return ({sleep:'Sleep',movement:'Movement',nutrition:'Nutrition',focus:'Focus',social:'Social',tools:'Stress tools'})[key] || key;
    }

    mapBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const sel = gatherGoals();
      buildPath(sel);
    });

    // Initialize empty map
    buildPath([]);

    // Contact send button basic behavior (demo only)
    sendBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const mail = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      const msg = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();
      // Light validation
      if(!mail || !msg){
        alert('Please include your email and a short note on what you hope to change.');
        return;
      }
      // Provide a friendly simulated response
      sendBtn.disabled = true; sendBtn.textContent = 'Sending...';
      setTimeout(()=>{
        sendBtn.disabled = false; sendBtn.textContent = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';
        alert('Thanks — a short confirmation will arrive at '+mail+". We'll follow up to clarify next steps.");
      },900);
    });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"This chunk contains the contact page and notes for the wellness coach site.

Files included:
- contact.html: Self-contained contact page with interactive features.

Key interactive features (local JS only):
- Mood-to-Method selector
  - Dropdown selects current state (calm, overwhelmed, stuck, energized, adrift).
  - The recommended method card updates to show a short set of immediate steps.
  - The primary CTA (send button) text updates to reflect the recommended micro-offer.

- Progress meter / 30-day path map
  - Checkboxes let the user choose up to 4 goals (Sleep, Movement, Nutrition, Focus, Social, Stress tools).
  - "Map my 30‑day path" builds a 30-tile grid with color-coded daily focus items and a small week-by-week prompt.
  - No external services; all rendering is handled in-page.

Placeholders present (must be replaced by the build system):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Implementation notes:
- No external assets or CDNs required. The page references an SVG pattern in the overall project at assets/img/pattern.svg if present; this page does not require that asset to function.
- The contact form action is simulated: it validates presence of email and message then shows a mock confirmation.
- All copy avoids medical claims and focuses on habits, frameworks, and outcomes.

How to test locally:
1. Open contact.html in a browser.
2. Try the Mood dropdown — observe the method card and CTA text change.
3. Select several goals and click "Map my 30‑day path" to render the tile grid and legend.
4. Fill form fields and press the CTA to see the simulated send flow.

Accessibility and behavior:
- Simple semantic elements are used; tiles have title attributes for quick hover information.
- The design intentionally keeps color contrasts moderate and relies on text labels alongside color.

Developer tips:
- To change the mood-method options or colors, edit the `methods` constant and `colorMap` in the script inside contact.html.
- The CTA uses the placeholder {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} as a default; mood choices temporarily override its text when selected.

End of README."}
BUNDLE_END
